{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1310,\"title\":\"Sanctuary\",\"tagline\":\"Some hide. They seek.\",\"overview\":\"The adventures of the beautiful, enigmatic and always surprising Dr. Helen Magnus, a brilliant scientist who holds the secrets of a clandestine population called Abnormals—a group of strange and sometimes terrifying beings that hide among humans. Magnus seeks to protect this threatened phenomena as well as unlock the mysteries behind their existence.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7KIBYETkRSfHNsfWAWAt7uq7oGm.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gTyZ24A6H4YgdYzmJ2VWoYoGTzs.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":315,\"year\":2008,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":4,\"totalEpisodes\":59,\"createdBy\":[\"Damian Kindler\"],\"networks\":[\"Syfy\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2011-12-30\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1214381,\"name\":\"Martin Wood\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/45imLzo7mXQY3ifrn7BVcRzw4XE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1318219,\"name\":\"Steven A. Adelson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":108888,\"name\":\"Brenton Spencer\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n2SxRJCprcSmYAgwtwczDc7kQAK.jpg\"},{\"id\":115212,\"name\":\"Lee Wilson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":118463,\"name\":\"Peter DeLuise\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sLkSOm6HBLB4VCfshQLdSEq63tr.jpg\"},{\"id\":26063,\"name\":\"Damian Kindler\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mwHQNja229qRrnX8udmDJaOf3AG.jpg\"},{\"id\":26087,\"name\":\"Amanda Tapping\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ZiETPxUFtgrtWL0LgMwPP8ytuK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1222912,\"name\"